00:39:42.840 --> 00:39:47.340
What is that the equation of?

00:39:52.540 --> 00:39:54.790
What is that?

00:39:54.980 --> 00:39:58.720
The parametric form of a
transformed line.

00:39:58.720 --> 00:40:00.800
Exactly.
It's also the parametric form of

