01:03:15.940 --> 01:03:17.100
But AB,

01:03:17.100 --> 01:03:21.600
does that rotate first, or does
it scale first?

01:03:22.280 --> 01:03:26.030
Why does it rotate first?

01:03:26.220 --> 01:03:30.060
It's when you put the vectors on
the most right-hand side.

01:03:30.060 --> 01:03:30.980
Good.

01:03:30.980 --> 01:03:32.600
That's which supplies.

01:03:32.600 --> 01:03:34.520
This is very counterintuitive,
