01:10:53.100 --> 01:10:56.560
But I'm keeping the bottom
standard basis vector in place.

01:10:56.560 --> 01:10:59.280
This is what's called a
horizontal shear,

01:10:59.280 --> 01:11:03.280
a vertical shear, you could
