Exactly.

01:12:07.320 --> 01:12:09.900
In every other transformation
we've seen, Including the ones

01:12:09.900 --> 01:12:12.660
that were made up of multiple
smaller transformations

01:12:12.660 --> 01:12:16.580
This square that you saw in blue
on the left was transformed into

01:12:16.580 --> 01:12:20.330
some sort of parallelogram on
the right still with some area

01:12:20.720 --> 01:12:21.720
Okay

01:12:21.920 --> 01:12:24.480
All right, that was true here.
That was true here.

01:12:24.480 --> 01:12:26.520
That was true here

01:12:26.520 --> 01:12:29.520
Square turned into parallelogram

01:12:31.160 --> 01:12:35.660
There we go not true now

01:12:36.860 --> 01:12:37.660
Why?

01:12:37.660 --> 01:12:41.060
Well, it's because the standard
