01:12:53.880 --> 01:12:57.200
whether I can undo a
transformation.

01:12:57.200 --> 01:12:58.780
And if you think about the
transformations we've seen

01:12:58.780 --> 01:12:59.620
before,

01:12:59.620 --> 01:13:01.760
you can imagine how I might undo
them.

01:13:01.760 --> 01:13:03.000
For example,

01:13:03.000 --> 01:13:07.240
if I have a machine that rotates
things by 30 degrees, can I undo

01:13:07.240 --> 01:13:08.060
that?

01:13:08.060 --> 01:13:11.000
Sure, just unrotate by 30
degrees or rotate by negative 30

01:13:11.000 --> 01:13:13.020
degrees.
If I have a machine that

01:13:13.020 --> 01:13:16.300
stretches the x by 5 and the y
by negative 2,

