01:13:41.100 --> 01:13:44.100
can that be undone?

01:13:44.660 --> 01:13:45.440
Well,

01:13:45.440 --> 01:13:49.660
not exactly, because if I
consider the vector 2,

01:13:59.540 --> 01:14:00.540
2

01:14:04.540 --> 01:14:08.240
They both end up at the same
