01:14:11.920 --> 01:14:15.480
Really what this transformation
is doing is say, keep the x

01:14:15.480 --> 01:14:18.780
component and set the y
component to 0.

01:14:18.780 --> 01:14:20.120
That's all this is doing.

01:14:20.120 --> 01:14:21.300
Do we agree?

01:14:21.300 --> 01:14:21.820
Okay.

01:14:21.820 --> 01:14:24.380
So if I tell you, okay, a vector
that came out of the

01:14:24.380 --> 01:14:26.240
