01:14:36.520 --> 01:14:37.900
2, 0.

01:14:37.900 --> 01:14:39.460
Do we agree?

01:14:39.460 --> 01:14:43.400
Okay, so is this transformation
reversible or invertible?

01:14:45.760 --> 01:14:46.760
No.
Now,

01:14:47.400 --> 01:14:53.340
transformation can't be

01:14:53.340 --> 01:14:54.340
